    "new": "this.parkoured = 'leap';",
    "tests": [
      "test/auditclimbarc.test.js"
    ],
    "equivalent": true,
    "why": "No frame bills a move before a launch: every launch (the eject, the running leap, the late press) asks a fresh Jump, every billed move before it in the frame latches the Jump (_parkourBegin's _pkJumpLatch, a grab's), and a frame's input is one input - so the frame's flag is always empty when _pkLaunch writes it. Kept as the list's form; the catch's and a move's concat (the reachable ones) are pinned."
